# Thrift Flip — environment. Copy to .env.local for `vercel dev`; set the same
# values in the Vercel project for deploys. Never commit a filled-in copy —
# .env and *.local are gitignored.
#
# The Gemini key is NOT here. It is bring-your-own-key, pasted in Settings and
# encrypted into the on-device vault (N1-lite). No AI secret is ever a build
# input.

# ── Server only (edge relays under api/) ────────────────────────────────────
# Never prefixed VITE_ — that would bake them into the client bundle.

# eBay developer keyset. Sandbox at E1; the production pair replaces these at E2.
EBAY_APP_ID=
EBAY_CERT_ID=
EBAY_ENV=sandbox

# Self-chosen, 32–80 characters. Registered in the eBay dashboard's alert
# settings alongside the deletion endpoint URL.
EBAY_VERIFICATION_TOKEN=

# The deletion endpoint's own URL, byte-identical to what is registered with
# eBay — it is the third input to the challenge hash. Not in E1's original
# prerequisite list; added because the derived fallback (x-forwarded-host) can
# disagree with the registered URL on a custom domain or preview deployment,
# and eBay reports that mismatch only as a flat rejection.
EBAY_DELETION_ENDPOINT_URL=https://your-domain.vercel.app/api/ebay/deletion

# Shared secret gating api/ebay/* AND api/serpapi/*. A speed bump against a
# stranger who finds the URL, not authentication — the client half below ships
# inside the bundle and anyone with the bundle can read it (plan §6.1). Rotate
# with the eBay keyset.
RELAY_SECRET=

# SerpApi, for comps tier A (V2). Server-only: it is a metered key on a
# 250-searches/month plan, and a browser-visible one would be someone else's
# free scraper by the weekend.
#
# OPTIONAL, and today it changes nothing. eBay gates sold/completed search and
# SerpApi's eBay engine does not get through it — measured 2026-07-28 across
# four sessions and seven queries, every one returning 0 rows or a 503, while
# the same engine returns 240 rows with the filter removed. With or without
# this key the relay answers `unavailable` and the app falls back to the
# model's price, exactly as it did before V2. Set it when a sold source works.
SERPAPI_KEY=

# ── Client (bundled into the build — assume public) ─────────────────────────

VITE_EBAY_APP_ID=
VITE_EBAY_RU_NAME=
VITE_EBAY_ENV=sandbox
VITE_RELAY_SECRET=
